">&quot;Anthropic says Claude doesn&#39;t silently sabotage&quot; OR &quot;edwinarbus&quot; &quot;overcaution&quot;</a>\n<a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Trustly+60M+Nordic+Capital+2026+tech.eu&client=app-vertex-grounding&safesearch=active\">Trustly 60M Nordic Capital 2026 tech.eu</a>\n<a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://www.google.com/search?q=Wired+Q.ANT+Michael+Fortsch+photonic+processors&client=app-vertex-grounding&safesearch=active\">Wired Q.ANT Michael Fortsch photonic processors</a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
